<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back">‹</view><view class="top-title"><view class="top-title-main">删除社群内容</view><view class="top-title-sub">仅管理你发布的经历、评论和公开路线</view></view></view><view class="safe-tip">选择一项后会再次确认，其他用户的内容不会受到影响。</view><view class="section-title">我发布的经历</view><view wx:if="{{posts.length}}" class="stack gap-12"><view wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id" class="social-card"><view class="avatar">{{initial}}</view><view class="grow copy"><view class="content-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="tiny">{{nickname}} · {{item.time}}</view><view class="route-state">{{item.route}}</view></view><view class="delete-link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="deletePost">删除</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty-card">你还没有发布可删除的经历</view><view class="section-title">我的评论</view><view wx:if="{{comments.length}}" class="stack gap-12"><view wx:for="{{comments}}" wx:key="index" class="social-card"><view class="avatar">{{initial}}</view><view class="grow copy"><view class="content-title">{{item.text}}</view><view class="tiny">评论于《{{item.postTitle}}》 · {{item.time}}</view></view><view class="delete-link" data-postid="{{item.postId}}" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="deleteComment">删除</view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty-card">你还没有发布可删除的评论</view></view>
